  _title: "Cidade Vira Destino de N\xF4mades Digitais"
  _description: "Trabalhadores remotos do mundo inteiro escolheram a cidade pra viver.
    Fen\xF4meno real: Lisboa, Medell\xEDn e Bali, entre outras, viraram destino de
    n\xF4made digital \u2014 algumas j\xE1 t\xEAm visto pr\xF3prio pra isso \u2014
    mas o aluguel sobe pra quem sempre morou ali."
  _titleEn: City Becomes a Digital Nomad Destination
  _descriptionEn: "Remote workers from around the world chose the city to live in.
    Real phenomenon: Lisbon, Medell\xEDn and Bali, among others, became digital nomad
    destinations \u2014 some even have dedicated visas \u2014 but rent rises for
    longtime residents."
